{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集上演激烈水上混戰，焦點竟落在自認「全場最弱」的CEO Tony身上！身形瘦削兼不諳水性的他，在「水上騎膊馬」環節中論論盡盡，最終更腳軟收場，場面爆笑，但他全力以赴的模樣卻意外圈粉，究竟發生了什麼事？\n</p>\n<h2>Tony自認最弱孭Kanis腳震 最終不戰而敗勁爆笑</h2>\n<p>在「水上騎膊馬」大混戰中，身形瘦削的「笑笑口 CEO」Tony賽前已被睇低一線，連他自己亦坦言「完全唔識游水」，並自封「全場最弱」：「我本身體重較輕，叫我孭幾十 Kilo，再做深蹲係有啲困擾。」當他孭起拍檔Kanis時，弱點便表露無遺，Kanis事後也笑言：「我一上去就 Feel 到佢腳震。」果不其然，比賽開始後不久，Tony便因體力不支而雙腳顫抖，最終更因腳軟而自行跌落水，導致Kanis「不戰而敗」，場面既狼狽又搞笑，瞬間成為全場焦點。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚Tony真性情有喜感 「笑到我流眼淚」</h2>\n<p>雖然Tony在遊戲中迅速落敗，但他論論盡盡卻依然全力以赴的模樣，反而大受網民歡迎，認為他展現了真實有趣的一面，紛紛留言大讚他充滿綜藝感。「笑到我流眼淚」、「佢啲真性情真係幾搞笑」、「Tony 好得意」、「一向都覺得佢好有喜感」、「Tony 同 Kanis 都好有綜藝感」、「Tony 有勇氣同埋願意為鍾意嘅人付出。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_8484666876ae8052e5e23e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_8484666876ae8052e5e23e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_465141296ae805313564b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_465141296ae805313564b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_15541261116ae8053403997.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_15541261116ae8053403997.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_1756601236ae80537549c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_1756601236ae80537549c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_3126269926ae8053da1ce8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_3126269926ae8053da1ce8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/49_16873305116ae8054089e66.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/49_16873305116ae8054089e66.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:47.206209+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":825,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:20:12.883814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:20.636919+00:00","content_hash":"0850547d8e050f49377ef3bb2d9969771e332d7c1f6d013f456034642d01b007","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}